ら強制的にエッチをするように言いつけられてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63430"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e69cfa835b6a42dc308e55b2d4476accf5ff0ddbf1325e5296dfb1d1593adb9a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2625155481c4f0b1a1b1a167acf0262bae5f8c77325cfb7617b1ceff3dc45ee.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ヒマリ","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85168","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c69588","characterName":"セイラ＝A＝仙賀","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["20363"],"vndbCharacterId":"c69588"},"originalCharacterName":"セイラ＝A＝仙賀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A daughter of the dragon tribe who has quite irresponsible personality. She's also a third year like Taichi, but is in a different class from Taichi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because Seira's grandmother and father are dragons from overseas, her body has inherited an oriental, non-Japanese appearance and atmosphere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The dragon tribe possesses top-class powers among demi-humans which is why Seira is uninterested in \"Awakening Essence\", but she falls for Taichi at the first sight and joins the competition for him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69588"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結構いい加減な性格の人竜族の娘。太壱とはグラスが違う学園の三年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖父母、父が海外の人竜族の為、その影響で日本人離れしたオリエンタルな雰囲気とボディを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人竜族は亜人種の中でもトップクラスの力を持っている為、『覚醒の魔素』に無関心だったが、太壱に一目惚れし、参戦する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20363","sourceWorkId":"26624","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a147a398221ce9cf783d5c5c9dc2a579309a9e8f60f973088e41910708874cef.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77c170d8ae1212a4752a646e64e3ad24be510f0866f3f656c6358095e159b928.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85171","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c69589","characterName":"鬼上 鈴鹿","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63431","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"241844"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20364"],"vndbCharacterId":"c69589"},"originalCharacterName":"鬼上 鈴鹿","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cool and sadistic daughter of the oni tribe, who is in her second year of high school, Taichi's junior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suzuka was confessed to by Taichi, but turned him down without mercy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of \"Awakening Essence\", Suzuka is told by her mother to ensnare Taichi so that her clan could monopolize him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69589"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでＳな鬼族の娘で学園の二年生。太壱の後輩。太壱に告白されるが、容赦なく振る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『覚醒の魔素』の一件で、母親から一族で独占出来るように太壱を籠絡するように言い渡されてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20364","sourceWorkId":"26624","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでSな鬼族の娘で学園の二年生。太壱の後輩。"},{"spoil