n tribe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"According to the family's law, Sally has been married off since she was born. Being married regardless of her wishes, and she is ignorant of sexual matters. Perhaps because of her repressed life, she has an unusual longing for forbidden love. After being chosen as a candidate for Holic Milk, Sally confesses her secret feelings to Taichi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91976"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のヒロインの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セイラの母親。日本生まれ、日本育ちだが、ルーツがインドの八大竜王にある為か、先祖返りで日本離れしたエキゾチックな見た目をしている。気性の激しい人竜族の中にあって、やや控えめな性格をしている。一族の掟で生まれた頃から、許嫁が決まっていて、適齢期になると同時に本人の意思とは関係なく結婚し、セイラをもうけた為、性的な事は無知に近い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"抑圧されてきた人生の為か、内心燃え上がるような恋や禁断の恋に異常なあこがれを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖乳候補に選ばれた事で、その秘めた想いを太壱にぶつけてくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22894","sourceWorkId":"29791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のヒロインの一人。セイラの母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本生まれ、日本育ちだが、ルーツがインドの八大竜王にある為か、先祖返りで日本離れしたエキゾチックな見た目をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気性の激しい人竜族の中にあって、やや控えめな性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一族の掟で生まれた頃から、許嫁が決まっていて、適齢期になると同時に本人の意思とは関係なく結婚し、セイラをもうけた為、性的な事は無知に近い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"抑圧されてきた人生の為か、内心燃え上がるような恋や禁断の恋に異常なあこがれを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖乳候補に選ばれた事で、その秘めた想いを太壱にぶつけてくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"85358"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c0b48e8251b026d14870123b0ad5b65443d7943d8c180edf093efce920d2a45.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4b68d4e41ccd5b8cc259de7aef61e4384cfa0067b14fb94b233b47e3997cc70.webp","width":167,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤本教子","creatorId":"vndb:s649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s649","name":"平野響子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:310158:85358:5669:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91977","characterName":"白狛千 茜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"85359","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"310158"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22895"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91977"},"originalCharacterName":"白狛千 茜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young girl of the Oni tribe, Akane is a guard of the Hakukoma Senryu, who was sent in place of Kikyou, who was removed from Taiichi's guard to ensure the safety of the comatosed Kuon, Suzuka and Seira."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In Shirakomachi family, Akane and Kikyou are the only members, and they are not related (they are of different races to begin with). The only people who can call themselves the Shirakomachi are the eight highest-ranking members of the family, excluding the successor to the original family, who received the full range of licenses in the same era. Akane is the first of the Oni clan to receive the Shirakomachi title, so she has earned her her clan's respect and pride."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akane is proud and has a great admiration for Kikyou, calling her her \"big sister\", and she is jealous of Taichi when she sees Kikyou pampering him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91977"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼族の少女で、昏睡した紅音、鈴鹿、セイラの安全を確保する為に太壱の護衛から外れた桔梗の代わりに派遣された白狛千流の警備員。白狛千姓ではあるが、本家は桔梗のみで、血縁は一切ない。（そもそも種族も違う）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『白狛千』を名乗れるのは、本家後継者を除く同時代に免許皆伝を受けた最高位の八名だけである。鬼族初の『白狛千』という事で、一族からも期待され、本人も強い誇りを持っている。桔梗の事を『姉様』と強いあこがれを持って慕っているので、太壱を甘やかす姿を見て、彼に内心強い嫉妬心を持っている。普段は、ほとんど感情を表に出さない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22895","sourceWorkId":"29791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼族の少女で、昏睡した紅音、鈴鹿、セイラの安全を確保する為に太壱の護衛から外れた桔梗の代わりに派遣された白狛千流の警備員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"白狛千姓ではあるが、本家は桔梗のみで、血縁は一切ない。（そもそも種族も違う）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『白狛千』を名乗れるのは、本家後継者を除く同時代に免許皆伝を受けた最高位の八名だけである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼族初の『白狛千』という事で、一族からも期待され、本人も強い誇りを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桔梗の事を『姉様』と強いあこがれを持って慕っているので、太壱を甘やかす姿を見て、彼に内心強い嫉妬心を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は、ほとんど感情を表に出さない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"85359"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/500116ddf405054613444f149eef3a62ce0c596beb46987a871d215c9e5457b2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e383c49cd53df6653890c27a17044b9147bdd45bd088fb33210824a8a3053b08.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:310158:85359:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91978","characterName":"ミーメ・ファヴニル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"85360","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"310158"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22896"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91978"},"originalCharacterName":"ミーメ・ファヴニル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-o